  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PY Modernnization of Paraguay&apos;s Congress IDF</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the grant is to strengthen the institutional capacity of the Recipient&apos;s National Congress (NC), through: (a) Improvement of communication and participation channels; (b) Implementaion of best practices from internationally recognized legislative bodies; (c) Increase of parliamentary transparency and efficiency; and (d) Access to the Global Legal Information Network (GLIN) system.  The TF overall development objective is to strengthen the institutional capacity of the National Congress through: (i) improvement of communication and participation channels; (ii) improvement of best practices from internationally recognized legislative bodies; (iii) increase of parliamentary transparency and efficiency; and, (iv) access to the Global Legal Information Network (GLIN) .</narrative>
  </description>
